            "pk": "17883883193966892",
            "text": "🚀 Exciting News! Participants of Silkway Accelerator have collectively secured $8.1 million in investments!\n\nSilkway Accelerator, a joint program by Google for Startups and Astana Hub, has solidified its position as the region’s premier accelerator. Here, startups thrive, scale, and attract significant investments.\n\n🌐 Kazakhstan remains the first and only country in Central Asia to host an accelerator in collaboration with the global powerhouse Google for Startups. On November 17, 2023, the Demo Day of the fourth batch of the Silkway Accelerator from Astana Hub and Google for Startups was held at the Astana Hub tech park.\n\n✨ Stay tuned for the latest news on Astana Hub’s social media."
